{"id":"74c997e395e53951","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-complete-lattice.md","title":"Complete Lattice","display":"df-complete-lattice — Complete Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-complete-lattice","aliases":["93-df-complete-lattice"],"display":"df-complete-lattice — Complete Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-complete-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-complete-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-lattice — Complete Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> is the induced order of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf L|\\;\\exists s,i\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;i\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\n\\land\\forall l\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\\to l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}i)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf L|\\;\\exists s,i\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;i\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\n\\land\\forall l\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\\to l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}i)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two witnesses are the supremum and infimum of the arbitrary subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; allowing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span> supplies top and bottom. No external carrier or order is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf L}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf L|\\;\\exists s,i\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad(\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbf L}u)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;i\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\n\\land\\forall l\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}x)\\to l\\leq_{\\mathbf L}i)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"053b08137256a80a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteLat}_{93}$ is the complete-lattice predicate of [[93-df-complete-lattice]]."}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203"]}